    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "maybe you're right. maybe the struggling is the worst part. it's just so much work to exist when it feels like it means nothing to anyone. if i just stopped trying, or if i just... wasn't here, do you think it would actually make a difference? like, would the world even feel any different if a ghost just finally disappeared?",
